Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 20:41:53 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat(ui): colour task progress bar by job stage and state

The tasks list showed a two-tone bar built from the three counters the
tasks endpoint returns. Split it into per stage/state segments: not
started, annotating, on review, accepted and rejected, plus a neutral
segment for jobs the current user cannot see.

The tasks endpoint has no counters for rejected / new / in progress
jobs, so a single filtered /api/jobs request per list page collects them
and they are aggregated client side. Until it resolves, and if it fails,
task items keep rendering the stock progress bar.

